{"server":"tw","storyId":"act13side_level_act13side_09_beg","groupId":"act13side","stageId":"act13side_09","title":"歎息","storyCode":"NL-9","avgTag":"行動前","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act13side/level_act13side_09_beg.txt","sourceHash":"b172305d2e1b665746c3a0d68fc11bc77b0c4dd767a95e811366c1cb0301394a","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"narration","text":"卡西米尔2-9-1"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_23_G09"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"礫","speakerId":"avg_237_gravel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......好消息，博士。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"礫","speakerId":"avg_237_gravel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"監正會同意羅德島各位的外出申請了，“讓重要的合作夥伴遊覽城市也是必要的”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"礫","speakerId":"avg_237_gravel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"本來，如果沒有這一系列事件發生的話，您可以在大騎士領更自由一些的。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"博士？您找我們嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"char_120_hibisc","isRemote":false,"text":"啊！騎士姐姐！正好我還有剩下的健康餐，你打包帶回家嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"礫","speakerId":"avg_237_gravel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜鶯","speakerId":"char_179_cgbird","isRemote":false,"text":"......您好，礫小姐，博士。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"難得有機會去卡西米爾的其他地方參觀。","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"想不想出去逛逛？","value":"2","blocks":[]},{"label":"休——假——時——間——","value":"3","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_23_G01"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大嘴莫布","speakerId":"avg_npc_121","isRemote":false,"text":"激烈的戰鬥！讓人不敢相信自己的眼睛！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大嘴莫布","speakerId":"avg_npc_121","isRemote":false,"text":"不對！應該說，一位名不見經傳的夢魘！首次闖入特錦賽，竟然就能與冠軍分庭抗禮！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大嘴莫布","speakerId":"avg_npc_121","isRemote":false,"text":"鮮紅的鎧甲在賽場上碰撞，讓今夜的月光也黯然失色！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大嘴莫布","speakerId":"avg_npc_121","isRemote":false,"text":"不用說，我想觀眾也感受到了，拓拉！“草原之恐”逐魘騎士！他那瘋狂的意志令人為之著迷沉醉！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大嘴莫布","speakerId":"avg_npc_121","isRemote":false,"text":"經歷了與耀騎士的那場決鬥之後，人氣居高不下的逐魘騎士！究竟能不能為他成為大騎士的故事中，再添一筆！？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大嘴莫布","speakerId":"avg_npc_121","isRemote":false,"text":"順帶一提，古代人娛樂公司正在舉行“騎士封號有獎競猜”！凡是能猜中騎士封號的觀眾，都能獲得精美禮品一份！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_214_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你的氣勢哪裡去了？夢魘？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"逐魘騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_225","isRemote":false,"text":"......唔。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"逐魘騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_225","isRemote":false,"text":"米諾斯人......在我的同胞鞭笞往日的時代，你們的英雄已經淪為了詩人口中的典故......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_214_1","isRemote":false,"text":"廢話囉嗦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_214_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那你的可汗如今在哪？你那些引以為豪的同胞活在大地何處？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"逐魘騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_225","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_214_1","isRemote":false,"text":"一個活在過去的夢魘，一個可憐人罷了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"逐魘騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_225","isRemote":false,"text":"......米諾斯人，感染者，你為什麼而戰？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_214_1","isRemote":false,"text":"生存。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_214_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他們把我奉為感染者的英雄......把我當做歷史的標杆，但我的初衷，僅僅是活著。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"逐魘騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_225","isRemote":false,"text":"......感染者的英雄？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"逐魘騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_225","isRemote":false,"text":"原來如此......你也在為你的同胞而戰嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_214_1","isRemote":false,"text":"同胞......？不，我們並無血緣，也沒有相同的故鄉，我們只是不幸患上了同一種疾病而已。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_214_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他們的遭遇令我感到悲憫，所以我去拯救他們，為所有人尋覓出路。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"逐魘騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_225","isRemote":false,"text":"不是同胞......你卻還要，拯救他們。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"逐魘騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_225","isRemote":false,"text":"......可笑。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"逐魘騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_225","isRemote":false,"text":"你的確強大......但是，卡西米爾的草原難道已經被感染者和異國人瓜分了嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"逐魘騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_225","isRemote":false,"text":"卡西米爾人，庫蘭塔，他們在哪！？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"逐魘騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_225","isRemote":false,"text":"難道我千里迢迢來到騎士之國，是為了和感染者、米諾斯人和自己的同族決鬥的嗎！？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"逐魘騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_225","isRemote":false,"text":"——奇恥大辱！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_23_G07"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"char_120_hibisc","isRemote":false,"text":"哇哇哇......這、這裡就是卡西米爾的商業中心嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"礫","speakerId":"avg_237_gravel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嚴格來說，這裡只是大騎士領大小數百個商業中心中的一個。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"礫","speakerId":"avg_237_gravel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"因為距離比較近，所以我推薦來這裡罷了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"char_120_hibisc","isRemote":false,"text":"但是垃圾食品是不是太多了！我一眼看過去，視野裡就有三家爆米花店、兩家披薩店和四家漢堡店哦！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"char_120_hibisc","isRemote":false,"text":"這是不行的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"啊哈哈......因為這附近有一座騎士競技場嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"礫","speakerId":"avg_237_gravel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"當然。競技場算是每一個商業圈的核心。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"礫","speakerId":"avg_237_gravel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"圍繞著騎士們的廝殺拓展商業，就是這麼一回事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜鶯","speakerId":"char_179_cgbird","isRemote":false,"text":"......！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜鶯","speakerId":"char_179_cgbird","isRemote":false,"text":"......這是......臨光的玩偶？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"char_120_hibisc","isRemote":false,"text":"啊！好可愛！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"......等等，這家店，難道全是......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"店主","speakerId":"avg_npc_001","isRemote":false,"text":"唷，幾位客人，是耀騎士的粉絲？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"店主","speakerId":"avg_npc_001","isRemote":false,"text":"那你可來對地方啦，這裡是耀騎士周邊專賣！黏土小人、毛絨玩偶、臨光家族徽章應有盡有！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"店主","speakerId":"avg_npc_001","isRemote":false,"text":"順便一提，如果耀騎士能打敗風騎士再度進入決賽，供應商還考慮製作精煉源石雕刻紀念品！現在可以先付定金哦？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"店主","speakerId":"avg_npc_001","isRemote":false,"text":"反正耀騎士一定會贏嘛！哈哈哈！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"(替夜鶯買一個玩偶。)","value":"1","blocks":[{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"店主","speakerId":"avg_npc_001","isRemote":false,"text":"謝謝惠顧！"}]},{"label":"(詢問定金是多少。)","value":"2","blocks":[{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"店主","speakerId":"avg_npc_001","isRemote":false,"text":"是——啊，您是用外幣結算的嗎？龍門幣？那您可能還得先去一趟銀行。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"店主","speakerId":"avg_npc_001","isRemote":false,"text":"我幫你換算一下，大概一百三十萬龍門幣左右吧？"}]},{"label":"(反問對方耀騎士用過的盾牌能不能當做鎮店之寶。)","value":"3","blocks":[{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"店主","speakerId":"avg_npc_001","isRemote":false,"text":"盾牌？耀騎士什麼時候用過盾牌？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"店主","speakerId":"avg_npc_001","isRemote":false,"text":"不過，我們這裡有戰錘、雙刃劍和最新的劍槍模型。您要不看看？"}]}]},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_23_G08"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大嘴莫布","speakerId":"avg_npc_121","isRemote":false,"text":"難捨難分！逐魘騎士的一擊凌厲攻擊再度被血騎士擋下，而冠軍就像是切開豆腐般，將人工地形夷為平地！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大嘴莫布","speakerId":"avg_npc_121","isRemote":false,"text":"時間已經過去了十分鐘！風暴般的交鋒仍在繼續！究竟是誰，會在這彷彿永不停歇的攻擊中展露疲態！？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大嘴莫布","speakerId":"avg_npc_121","isRemote":false,"text":"——說話間！冠軍再次使用了法術！躲過了對手的一記掃擊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大嘴莫布","speakerId":"avg_npc_121","isRemote":false,"text":"難道雙方還在小心翼翼地試探對方嗎！？冠軍與夢魘，至今還沒人主動施放自己的源石技藝——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_23_G01"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"逐魘騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_225","isRemote":false,"text":"......米諾斯人，你受過怎樣的訓練？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_214_1","isRemote":false,"text":"很遺憾，在成為騎士之前，我並沒有經歷過像樣的戰鬥訓練。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_214_1","isRemote":false,"text":"成為騎士之後，也只是邊打邊學。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"逐魘騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_225","isRemote":false,"text":"......天生的戰士。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_214_1","isRemote":false,"text":"年輕人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_214_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不是你的導師，但是，如果你渴望一個對手，我可以教你一件事情。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_214_1","isRemote":false,"text":"虛張聲勢的恐懼，對任何一個努力活在當下的人來說，都毫無意義。"},{"type":"narration","text":"血騎士後退了半步。\n鮮血滲出他的鎧甲，在空中凝聚成流。\n紅光包裹在他的武器上，就像審判的利刃。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_214_1","isRemote":false,"text":"回答我，夢魘，在你夢裡的歷史中，在那上千年前至今的歷史之中——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_214_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可曾有感染者的丁點生機？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"逐魘騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_225","isRemote":false,"text":"......你......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_214_1","isRemote":false,"text":"別感到怯懦，夢魘！自稱怯薛的夢魘！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_214_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你的可汗在哪！讓他上前來！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_23_G01"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"耀騎士","speakerId":"avg_1014_nearl2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你的可汗在哪裡？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_23_G05"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_120","isRemote":false,"text":"你的可汗在哪裡？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_county_1"},{"type":"narration","text":"可汗的歷史已經過去上千年了。\n你只能在歷史書上找到他，孩子。\n怯薛？那些人是可汗的侍從，他們是這片大地上最勇武的戰士。\n可汗征服過很多地方，但是，也幹過許多傷害他人的事情。\n散播恐懼是夢魘的天性，征服欲幾乎是可汗的食糧。\n但是呢，拓拉。\n你生在這片大地之上，你會找到你自己的——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_23_G01"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"逐魘騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_225","isRemote":false,"text":"......父親，勁敵，導師，理想。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"逐魘騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_225","isRemote":false,"text":"我竟然......試圖在這座城市尋找這些？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"逐魘騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_225","isRemote":false,"text":"不！夢該醒了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"逐魘騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_225","isRemote":false,"text":"這只是留念，我為自己畫下的天途的道路，早有註定。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_black"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_214_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"逐魘騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_225","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_214_1","isRemote":false,"text":"禱告結束了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"逐魘騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_225","isRemote":false,"text":"我的家人都死了。我的同族都迷失了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"逐魘騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_225","isRemote":false,"text":"——可汗就在我的刀尖之上。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"逐魘騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_225","isRemote":false,"text":"我——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"逐魘騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_225","isRemote":false,"text":"——就是我自己的可汗！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"逐魘騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_225","isRemote":false,"text":"來！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_23_G05"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫妮克","speakerId":"avg_npc_208_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......天氣，晴。無風日，適合射箭的日子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫妮克","speakerId":"avg_npc_208_1","isRemote":false,"text":"目標，羅德島領袖兩人，種族不明的頭罩人，還有一個卡特斯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫妮克","speakerId":"avg_npc_208_1","isRemote":false,"text":"心情......很糟糕。因為每一次都有人妨礙工作。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"閃靈","speakerId":"char_147_shining","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫妮克","speakerId":"avg_npc_208_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......補充，心情非常糟糕。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"閃靈","speakerId":"char_147_shining","isRemote":false,"text":"你有寫日記的習慣嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫妮克","speakerId":"avg_npc_208_1","isRemote":false,"text":"誰會故意留下這些東西，送給監正會幫忙定罪嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"閃靈","speakerId":"char_147_shining","isRemote":false,"text":"那看來，你是個會把個人情緒帶入工作的人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫妮克","speakerId":"avg_npc_208_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......赦罪師，耀騎士，還有那個給人感覺很古怪的卡特斯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫妮克","speakerId":"avg_npc_208_1","isRemote":false,"text":"羅德島到底是什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"閃靈","speakerId":"char_147_shining","isRemote":false,"text":"之前一直沒有機會問問你們......你們......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"閃靈","speakerId":"char_147_shining","isRemote":false,"text":"從哪裡聽到“赦罪師”這個名字的？"},{"type":"narration","text":"莫妮克不是沒有見過面前的薩卡茲出手。\n出色的劍術，夾雜著一些無法理解的源石技藝，也許是巫術，和耀騎士一起擋住了玄鐵一箭。\n她心底裡其實想過，也許那時候的“出手阻攔”還不是這個薩卡茲的全部面貌。\n但是現在，她確信了一件事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫妮克","speakerId":"avg_npc_208_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我不可能告訴你的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"閃靈","speakerId":"char_147_shining","isRemote":false,"text":"我也沒有心慈手軟到，目睹一個殺手對博士和阿米婭張弓搭箭，還能放她走的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"閃靈","speakerId":"char_147_shining","isRemote":false,"text":"加上，之前的招呼，我們似乎沒有還禮，有失禮儀。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫妮克","speakerId":"avg_npc_208_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......輝光......？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫妮克","speakerId":"avg_npc_208_1","isRemote":false,"text":"耀騎士的同伴，都喜歡這麼閃亮亮的嗎？我都審美疲勞了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫妮克","speakerId":"avg_npc_208_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（很溫和......甚至感覺不到攻擊性......薩卡茲的巫術？）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫妮克","speakerId":"avg_npc_208_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（不......）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫妮克","speakerId":"avg_npc_208_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（她的神色......她對自己的劍感到悲哀嗎？）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"閃靈","speakerId":"char_147_shining","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫妮克","speakerId":"avg_npc_208_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......不回話嗎。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫妮克","speakerId":"avg_npc_208_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好吧，讓我來試試，你究竟有幾斤幾兩。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_23_G08"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大嘴莫布","speakerId":"avg_npc_121","isRemote":false,"text":"——發、發生了什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大嘴莫布","speakerId":"avg_npc_121","isRemote":false,"text":"是我眼花了嗎？賽場上突然彌漫起了黑霧——這並不罕見，但是，黑霧裡出現的，是什麼——？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大嘴莫布","speakerId":"avg_npc_121","isRemote":false,"text":"那是——旗、旗幟嗎？不，那是軍隊！？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"耀騎士","speakerId":"avg_1014_nearl2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"耀騎士","speakerId":"avg_1014_nearl2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這就是......你的執念嗎？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_23_G01"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"逐魘騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_225","isRemote":false,"text":"——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_214_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......可惜。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_214_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那些在觀眾席上遠觀的騎士們，是體會不到我現在的感覺的吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_214_1","isRemote":false,"text":"長旗飄揚，號角聲響，一支軍隊......一個民族，一段歷史。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_214_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可是——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_214_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——這就是你放棄當下，像個瘋子一樣尋死的理由嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"逐魘騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_225","isRemote":false,"text":"——呵！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大嘴莫布","speakerId":"avg_npc_121","isRemote":false,"text":"夢魘騎士發動了襲擊！但、但是黑霧籠罩著賽場，我們看不清究竟發生了什麼！？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大嘴莫布","speakerId":"avg_npc_121","isRemote":false,"text":"是不是有什麼在黑霧裡前進！？難道逐魘騎士真正的法術，是召喚自己的先祖嗎！？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_214_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可笑。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_214_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你只是缺乏直面命運的勇氣罷了。"},{"type":"narration","text":"血騎士揮舞巨斧，他知道，他並非真的面對一支古老的怯薛軍隊。\n一個想要自我毀滅的年輕人。\n一個試圖召回前世的年輕人。\n漆黑的霧氣淹沒了血騎士如血的鎧甲。\n震動，疼痛，都讓人明白，這些召喚物並非虛體或幻覺。\n血騎士仍舊佇立不動，他在等待，在等待夢魘本人的襲擊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"逐魘騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_214_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（古老的語言）倒下吧，英雄！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"血騎士悶哼一聲。\n即使是卡西米爾最頂級的鎧甲，也在頃刻間發出哀嚎。\n刀刃劈開了鎧甲，強壯如血騎士也險些單膝跪地。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_214_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"逐魘騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_225","isRemote":false,"text":"——！傷口不夠深，唔！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_214_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你，傷了我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_214_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但我的血，也撫上了你的武器。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"逐魘騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_225","isRemote":false,"text":"（陷阱——！？）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_214_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不必羞恥，缺乏實戰經驗本來就是你的弱點。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_214_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你離所謂的“怯薛”，似乎還差得很遠。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_23_G05"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫妮克","speakerId":"avg_npc_208_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......你和耀騎士擋下玄鐵一箭的畫面，確實讓人印象深刻，哪怕是銀槍的天馬也不可能輕易擋下玄鐵的懲罰。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫妮克","speakerId":"avg_npc_208_1","isRemote":false,"text":"情報人員和我說，你們和耀騎士自稱“使徒”，是一個治療感染者的組織。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫妮克","speakerId":"avg_npc_208_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“醫師”，呵，看來，我該把這個情報人員丟進鉗獸籠。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"閃靈","speakerId":"char_147_shining","isRemote":false,"text":"......很遺憾，我並不喜歡戰鬥。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫妮克","speakerId":"avg_npc_208_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......是嗎。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫妮克","speakerId":"avg_npc_208_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我以前是個維多利亞的軍人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫妮克","speakerId":"avg_npc_208_1","isRemote":false,"text":"因為沒有貴族身份，當不上軍官，最後在聯合軍演上被商業聯合會挖來了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫妮克","speakerId":"avg_npc_208_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那個時候，我的上司們大概還在竊喜少了一個刺頭吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"閃靈","speakerId":"char_147_shining","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫妮克","speakerId":"avg_npc_208_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以，我對自己的射術還是很自信的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫妮克","speakerId":"avg_npc_208_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這個距離，正面接下我三箭，我就放棄對羅德島的計畫，怎麼樣？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"閃靈","speakerId":"char_147_shining","isRemote":false,"text":"我如何相信你？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫妮克","speakerId":"avg_npc_208_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......信不信由你，無胄盟有無數種辦法對付羅德島。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫妮克","speakerId":"avg_npc_208_1","isRemote":false,"text":"比如在他們現在毫無戒心拿在手上的玩偶，塗抹上一些有揮發性的藥物......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"閃靈","speakerId":"char_147_shining","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫妮克","speakerId":"avg_npc_208_1","isRemote":false,"text":"別拿這種眼神看我，安排這種事並不困難。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"閃靈","speakerId":"char_147_shining","isRemote":false,"text":"三箭。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫妮克","speakerId":"avg_npc_208_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......三箭。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫妮克","speakerId":"avg_npc_208_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呼......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫妮克","speakerId":"avg_npc_208_1","isRemote":false,"text":"第一箭。"},{"type":"narration","text":"莫妮克張弓搭箭，維多利亞最標準的姿勢。\n那些在軍隊裡的日子，年輕的莫妮克即是如此百步穿楊，深得賞識。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫妮克","speakerId":"avg_npc_208_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"閃靈","speakerId":"char_147_shining","isRemote":false,"text":"這一箭，太淺。"},{"type":"narration","text":"眼前的薩卡茲甚至沒有拔劍。\n出乎預料的結果使莫妮克頓時感到胸中一陣悶熱，不甘湧上心頭。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫妮克","speakerId":"avg_npc_208_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......第二箭。"},{"type":"narration","text":"再一次拉弓。\n曾在某個雨夜，莫妮克襲擊了一位一階征戰騎士。\n對方不是什麼名聲大噪的英雄，卻也是個實打實的烏卡戰爭老兵。\n靈敏的反應令他察覺到了暗箭，雙方扭打起來，跌落山崖。\n早春的卡西米爾樹林，春寒料峭，一場密林中的追逐戰，持續了七天七夜。\n在四肢的疼痛和耳旁的嗡鳴聲幾乎到達極限的時刻，她張弓搭箭，結果了正在水源旁飲水的目標。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"閃靈","speakerId":"char_147_shining","isRemote":false,"text":"......姿勢變了，眼神也變了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"閃靈","speakerId":"char_147_shining","isRemote":false,"text":"你就像一個伺機待發的獵人。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫妮克","speakerId":"avg_npc_208_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——！"},{"type":"narration","text":"被彈開的箭矢在半空中折成兩節。\n一節插在地上，一節沒入草坪，驚起幾隻閒聊的羽獸。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"閃靈","speakerId":"char_147_shining","isRemote":false,"text":"但我並不想成為獵物。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫妮克","speakerId":"avg_npc_208_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......赦罪師都是你這樣的劍客？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫妮克","speakerId":"avg_npc_208_1","isRemote":false,"text":"或者該問，羅德島像你這樣的人有很多嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"閃靈","speakerId":"char_147_shining","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫妮克","speakerId":"avg_npc_208_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（......羅德島的風險評估是不是要重做一下......）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫妮克","speakerId":"avg_npc_208_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......實話說吧，解決羅德島是董事會的任務。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫妮克","speakerId":"avg_npc_208_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但很快，我就不再聽命行動了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"閃靈","speakerId":"char_147_shining","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫妮克","speakerId":"avg_npc_208_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不信？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"閃靈","speakerId":"char_147_shining","isRemote":false,"text":"不......實際上，我並不感到意外。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"閃靈","speakerId":"char_147_shining","isRemote":false,"text":"我們的領導人，已經預見到了這一可能性。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"閃靈","speakerId":"char_147_shining","isRemote":false,"text":"所以你想說什麼？你想說這場決鬥，是建立在你的自尊心上？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫妮克","speakerId":"avg_npc_208_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我想說......你該試著使出全力，薩卡茲。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫妮克","speakerId":"avg_npc_208_1","isRemote":false,"text":"最後一箭。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_23_G01"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"逐魘騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_225","isRemote":false,"text":"......呃！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_214_1","isRemote":false,"text":"結束了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_23_G08"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大嘴莫布","speakerId":"avg_npc_121","isRemote":false,"text":"絕地反擊！勢大力沉的一擊，將縈繞賽場的黑霧徹底打散！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大嘴莫布","speakerId":"avg_npc_121","isRemote":false,"text":"如同浪濤般的聲勢，將逐魘騎士製造的幻覺在頃刻間摧毀！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大嘴莫布","speakerId":"avg_npc_121","isRemote":false,"text":"失策啊夢魘！棋差一著！面對掌握鮮血法術的血騎士，輕敵近身正是他最慘痛的失誤！！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪嘉烈","speakerId":"avg_1014_nearl2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......那會是幻覺嗎？那幾乎就是......一場戰爭。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_23_G01"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"逐魘騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_225","isRemote":false,"text":"......嘎啊......啊啊，啊啊......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大嘴莫布","speakerId":"avg_npc_121","isRemote":false,"text":"什麼！？如此近距離的衝擊，逐魘騎士竟然還站在賽場上！？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大嘴莫布","speakerId":"avg_npc_121","isRemote":false,"text":"不可思議！難道他還有反擊的——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_214_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——我是血騎士，向裁判團申請溝通。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_214_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......是的，他已經昏過去了，再慢會有生命危險，宣佈結果吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_23_G08"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大嘴莫布","speakerId":"avg_npc_121","isRemote":false,"text":"——裁判團作出了判決！毫無疑問，卡西米爾特別錦標賽首位進軍決賽的騎士已經誕生！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大嘴莫布","speakerId":"avg_npc_121","isRemote":false,"text":"夢魘與冠軍的決鬥！恐懼與恐懼的較量！已經得出了結果——！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大嘴莫布","speakerId":"avg_npc_121","isRemote":false,"text":"請允許我榮幸地宣佈，獲勝者是——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"在莫布宣佈獲勝者的姓名之前，賽場的角落，那扎眼的隔欄之後。\n有一位感染者騎士率先站了起來。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者騎士A","speakerId":"avg_npc_221","isRemote":false,"text":"血騎士！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者騎士B","speakerId":"avg_npc_220","isRemote":false,"text":"血騎士！血騎士！血騎士！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪嘉烈","speakerId":"avg_1014_nearl2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"都是......感染者？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_23_G05"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_220","isRemote":false,"text":"血騎士贏了！血騎士萬歲！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"觀賽的感染者","speakerId":"avg_npc_006","isRemote":false,"text":"血騎士！血騎士！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"觀賽的感染者","speakerId":"avg_npc_006","isRemote":false,"text":"血騎士！血騎士！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_black"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_23_G01"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_214_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"narration","text":"血騎士！血騎士！血騎士！\n血騎士！血騎士！血騎士！\n血騎士緩緩舉起了手，向觀眾示意。\n隨後他回過頭，看著仍舊沒有倒下的夢魘。\n視線上抬，在夢魘的背後，極遠方的觀眾席上，有著另一位騎士與血騎士視線相交。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_23_G08"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"耀騎士","speakerId":"avg_1014_nearl2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_23_G01"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_214_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_23_G08"},{"type":"narration","text":"血騎士！血騎士！血騎士！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大嘴莫布","speakerId":"avg_npc_121","isRemote":false,"text":"呃......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大嘴莫布","speakerId":"avg_npc_121","isRemote":false,"text":"（職業素養告訴我，在觀眾呐喊的時候我不該用麥克風插嘴，但是，好像大都是感染者......沒問題嗎？）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_23_G09"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"電視裡的聲音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"血騎士！血騎士！血騎士！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"燭騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_215_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......這就是卡西米爾感染者的英雄，瑪嘉烈。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"燭騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_215_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你打算，怎麼對付那個與你重疊的形象？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_23_G02"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"電視裡的聲音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"血騎士！血騎士！血騎士！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊奧萊塔·羅素","speakerId":"avg_npc_210_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這就是感染者......狄開俄波利斯。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_23_G03"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"電視裡的聲音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"血騎士！血騎士！血騎士！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"發言人馬克維茨","speakerId":"avg_npc_211_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......英雄，血騎士。真是誇張的號召力。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"發言人馬克維茨","speakerId":"avg_npc_211_1","isRemote":false,"text":"耀騎士雖然是一個抗爭的典範，但說到底，真正為感染者謀取了生存空間的，是血騎士狄開俄波利斯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"發言人馬克維茨","speakerId":"avg_npc_211_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......但是，他向我們俯首稱臣已經很久了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"發言人麥基","speakerId":"avg_npc_212_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我以一介媒體從業者的身份，對你的提案深感佩服，馬克維茨先生。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"發言人麥基","speakerId":"avg_npc_212_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但你也知道，這些......輿論只是一層軟保險。想確保事情萬無一失，我們得準備一些硬性措施。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"發言人馬克維茨","speakerId":"avg_npc_211_1","isRemote":false,"text":"當然。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"發言人馬克維茨","speakerId":"avg_npc_211_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我只是不希望所有人都......無路可退罷了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_23_G07"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"興奮的觀眾","speakerId":"avg_npc_032","isRemote":false,"text":"血騎士！血騎士贏了！！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"興奮的觀眾","speakerId":"avg_npc_032","isRemote":false,"text":"啊哈哈，我就知道血騎士是不可戰勝的！血騎士是不可戰勝的！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"興奮的觀眾","speakerId":"avg_npc_032","isRemote":false,"text":"唔哦，怎麼了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"興奮的觀眾","speakerId":"avg_npc_032","isRemote":false,"text":"那邊的屋頂......升起太陽了嗎？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_23_G05"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫妮克","speakerId":"avg_npc_208_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫妮克","speakerId":"avg_npc_208_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你——"},{"type":"narration","text":"薩卡茲就像是忌諱自己的法術被看見一般，默默垂下了眼瞼。\n短暫的光輝，如落日，依舊縈繞在薩卡茲的劍尖。\n像是想起了什麼似的，薩卡茲立刻改變了持劍的姿勢——將其抱入懷中。\n就好像那把劍不該出鞘。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫妮克","speakerId":"avg_npc_208_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫妮克","speakerId":"avg_npc_208_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......剛才......你是怎麼......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫妮克","speakerId":"avg_npc_208_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是薩卡茲的巫術嗎？不，但是方才我分明感到了......"},{"type":"narration","text":"生命的呼吸？不。靈魂的力量？不。\n某種更本質的，只在夢境與醉酒後的幻覺中能碰觸到的無形幻象。\n但毫無疑問，這個薩卡茲方才......在揮舞晨昏。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫妮克","speakerId":"avg_npc_208_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫妮克","speakerId":"avg_npc_208_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......嘁。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫妮克","speakerId":"avg_npc_208_1","isRemote":false,"text":"剛才那一劍......你這傢伙......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫妮克","speakerId":"avg_npc_208_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你本可以殺了我！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"閃靈","speakerId":"char_147_shining","isRemote":false,"text":"只是接下你三箭而已，無胄盟。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"閃靈","speakerId":"char_147_shining","isRemote":false,"text":"當然，如果你食言的話，我會的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫妮克","speakerId":"avg_npc_208_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你——"},{"type":"narration","text":"被抓住的感覺。\n不能隨意後退，會被追上......被什麼追上？這個薩卡茲？還是她的劍？\n還是她所抓住的......生命的本質？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫妮克","speakerId":"avg_npc_208_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"閃靈","speakerId":"char_147_shining","isRemote":false,"text":"......還要繼續嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫妮克","speakerId":"avg_npc_208_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......不。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫妮克","speakerId":"avg_npc_208_1","isRemote":false,"text":"工作，也是要講究契約精神的。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫妮克","speakerId":"avg_npc_208_1","isRemote":false,"text":"收隊，停止對羅德島一行人的跟蹤。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"閃靈","speakerId":"char_147_shining","isRemote":false,"text":"謝謝。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫妮克","speakerId":"avg_npc_208_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......問你一個無關緊要的問題。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"閃靈","speakerId":"char_147_shining","isRemote":false,"text":"出於對你信守承諾的尊重，我會考慮回答你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫妮克","speakerId":"avg_npc_208_1","isRemote":false,"text":"對你們薩卡茲而言，削去雙角有什麼......含義嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"閃靈","speakerId":"char_147_shining","isRemote":false,"text":"......因人而異。也許有些人認為，薩卡茲的身份本身就是詛咒，也許會透過這種方式隱藏身份。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"閃靈","speakerId":"char_147_shining","isRemote":false,"text":"或者，是某些巫術的媒介，某種法術的依託。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"閃靈","speakerId":"char_147_shining","isRemote":false,"text":"又或者......是某些異類部族的傳統。可能性有很多，但絕無定論。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫妮克","speakerId":"avg_npc_208_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"閃靈","speakerId":"char_147_shining","isRemote":false,"text":"怎麼了嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫妮克","speakerId":"avg_npc_208_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......不，沒什麼。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_002_amiya","aliases":["阿米婭"]},{"speakerId":"char_120_hibisc","aliases":["芙蓉"]},{"speakerId":"char_147_shining","aliases":["閃靈"]},{"speakerId":"char_179_cgbird","aliases":["夜鶯"]}]}
